<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>DQ Strawberry Sundae — The Lightest Classic Treat</h2>
<p>The DQ Strawberry Sundae delivers fruit-forward sweetness at 280 calories — 20 fewer than the Hot Fudge Sundae and 30 fewer than the Caramel Sundae. All three sundaes are priced identically at $3.79. The Strawberry Sundae is the right choice for guests who want a lighter, fruitier experience rather than the rich chocolate or caramel options. Browse all classic treats on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
<h2>Three DQ Sundaes Compared</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Sundae</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strawberry Sundae</td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>280 cal</td><td>Fresh strawberry — fruity, lightest</td></tr><tr><td>Hot Fudge Sundae</td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>300 cal</td><td>Warm fudge — classic, warm-cold contrast</td></tr><tr><td>Caramel Sundae</td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>310 cal</td><td>Rich caramel — sweetest, most calories</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2>Strawberry Sundae as a $7 Meal Deal Component</h2>
<p>The Small Sundae included in the <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal</a> can be a Strawberry Sundae — and at 280 calories it is the lightest sundae option to include in the combo. If you want a complete meal without the extra calories from fudge or caramel, requesting a Strawberry Sundae is a smart choice within the Meal Deal.</p>
